@host = http://localhost:5080
@officer = 1042

### health
GET {{host}}/health

### triage a claim
POST {{host}}/api/ai/claims/1001/triage
X-Officer-Id: {{officer}}

### record that the officer accepted the suggestion
POST {{host}}/api/ai/claims/1001/feedback
X-Officer-Id: {{officer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "outcome": "accepted", "finalCategory": null, "comment": null }

### record an override
POST {{host}}/api/ai/claims/1001/feedback
X-Officer-Id: {{officer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "outcome": "overridden", "finalCategory": "WORK_INJURY", "comment": "المستند يوضح إصابة عمل" }

### streamed summary (curl -N to see tokens arrive)
GET {{host}}/api/ai/claims/1001/summary/stream
